Z||000000||Shaun41178||01-27-2000||02:55 PM||||I have dyno results for the underdrive pulley the Fiero Store sells.  I don't have results from rpm but rather through mph<P>At 40 mph the pulley increased hp from approximately 98 hp to 103 hp.at 60 mph the pulley was the same amd its hard to tell but at 100 mph the pulley is the same or about 1-2 hp lower from the stock one.  It seems the pulley help more in the first gear on my car.  From 32-40 with a stock pulley I didn't break 100 hp at the wheels.  With the pulley from 32mph to 40 mph I had over 100hp with the biggest increase coming at 40 mph.<P>This was on my car.  Your car may very but this is to show the effectiveness of it. <P>Just thought some might like to know.  Your welcome.<BR>||||reg||14
